  <LineComment UId="21">
    <Text UId="22"> The folder structure of the software unit CentralFunctions correlates with the main navigation in the HMI.</Text>
  </LineComment>
  <NewLine UId="23" />
  <LineComment UId="24">
    <Text UId="25"> For easier orientation, all folders are listed, but some are empty because there is no PLC logic needed, there is only content on the HMI side.</Text>
  </LineComment>
  <NewLine UId="26" />
  <LineComment UId="27">
    <Text UId="28"> Any PLC logic that should relate to the screens on the HMI for that chapter can be added in this folder.</Text>
